{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-monitoring","title":"性能监控","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"app-launch-metrics","title":"启动性能度量","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/app-launch-metrics","wordCount":1206,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-api-monitoring","title":"网络与 API 监控","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/network-api-monitoring","wordCount":1269,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-battery-profiling","title":"内存与电量分析","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/memory-battery-profiling","wordCount":1519,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 性能监控\n\n性能问题比崩溃更隐蔽——应用没有\"死\"，但用户感知到\"慢\"。本章聚焦移动端三个关键性能维度的度量与上报：启动性能决定用户的第一印象；网络与 API 监控揭示端到端请求链路的瓶颈；内存与电量分析则捕捉那些在开发环境难以复现、但在用户真机上持续恶化的资源消耗问题。重点在\"如何建立度量体系并持续收集线上数据\"，而非具体的优化手段。\n"}